26.7213 26.713 26.9294 26.4751C27.1374 26.2371 27.8208 25.4338 28.0584 25.0769C28.2961 24.7201 28.5339 24.7795 28.8607 24.8984C29.1877 25.0176 30.9408 25.8801 31.2974 26.0586C31.367 26.0934 31.4321 26.1249 31.4924 26.154Z" fill="#ffffff" style="fill: #ffffff !important; stroke: none !important; opacity: 1 !important; visibility: visible !important;"/>
    </svg>
    <span class="ga-wa-online-dot"></span>
  </span>
  <span class="ga-whatsapp-text">Chat with us</span>
</a>
